<title>UK: W.H. Smith shareholders approve shr buyback.</title>
<headline>W.H. Smith shareholders approve shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders in British retailer W.H. Smith Group Plc on Tuesday approved the company's plan to buy back up to 28.5 million of its ordinary shares -- about 10 percent of its issued share capital.</p>
<p>The company said last month the earliest date it would make share purchases would be after its results statement scheduled for August 27.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
